data: {"type": "search_results", "agent": "DeepScout", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T22:53:32.195836", "content": {"results": [{"id": "sr_b85065", "title": "sports", "source": "armedforcessports.defense.gov", "url": "https://armedforcessports.defense.gov/", "snippet": "Secure .gov websites use HTTPS\nFeatured Events\nNews and Highlights\nAll-Marine Corps Men’s Golf wins first ever title at 2025 AFS Golf Championship, All-Army Women’s Team takes home the gold\n2025 Armed Forces Golf Championship set to tee off at MCRD, Parris Island\n Feb. 24, 2025 - The 2025 Armed Forces Golf Championship is set to begin Feb. 25 at The Legends Golf Course, Marine Corps Recruit Depot, Parris Island, S.C. Teams of six men and four women from each service component will compete to determine which branch is the best from tee to green. \nWorld Class Athlete Airman helps Air Force team sweep men’s 2025 Armed Forces Cross Country Championship\n Jan. 31, 2025 - Staying in a pack until the last mile, the Air Force elite athletes swept the podium and the team win in the men’s 10K divisio", "date": "2025-04-07T05:45:24+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_95fc7f", "title": "Speeches", "source": "www.defense.gov", "url": "https://www.defense.gov/Newsroom/Speeches/", "snippet": "March 29, 2025\n Remarks by Secretary of Defense Pete Hegseth at the 80th Reunion of Honor Ceremony on Iwo Jima (As Delivered) \nFeb. 12, 2025\n Opening Remarks by Secretary of Defense Pete Hegseth at Ukraine Defense Contact Group (As Delivered) \nJan. 17, 2025\n Farewell Remarks by Secretary of Defense Lloyd J. Austin III (As Delivered) \nJan. 16, 2025\n Remarks by Secretary of Defense Lloyd J. Austin III at the Armed Forces Farewell Tribute in Honor of President Biden (As Delivered) \nJan. 13, 2025\n Remarks by Deputy Secretary of Defense Kathleen H. Hicks at the Defense Innovation Board's Public Meeting \nJan. 10, 2025\n Keynote Address by Deputy Secretary of Defense Kathleen H. Hicks \"Outpacing the PRC: Lessons Learned for Strategic Competition\" (As Delivered) \nJan. 9, 2025\n Remarks by Secretary", "date": "2025-04-02T15:17:55+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_23c8a7", "title": "defense", "source": "media.defense.gov", "url": "http://media.defense.gov/", "snippet": "News | Feb. 19, 2025\nFederal Firefighters Who Combated California Wildfires Receive Pentagon Tour\nFederal Firefighters Who Combated California Wildfires Receive Pentagon Tour\nNews | Feb. 18, 2025\nU.S. Army Tank Crew Wins International Competition for First Time\nU.S. Army Tank Crew Wins International Competition for First Time\nNews | 19 hours ago\nDOD Support to the Southern Border in Photos\nDOD Support to the Southern Border in Photos\nNews | Feb. 14, 2025\nHegseth Lauds U.S.-Poland Alliance, Reemphasizes Call for NATO Countries to Increase Defense Spending\nHegseth Lauds U.S.-Poland Alliance, Reemphasizes Call for NATO Countries to Increase Defense Spending\nNews | Feb. 18, 2025\nBrown: Build the Force by Being Seen\nPress Products \nAdvisory | yesterday\nMilitary Commissions Media Invitation Anno", "date": "2025-02-22T07:55:48+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_f48f0c", "title": "Publications", "source": "www.defense.gov", "url": "https://www.defense.gov/News/Publications/", "snippet": "March 7, 2025\n Directing Modern Software Acquisition to Maximize Lethality \nMarch 3, 2025\n Guidance for Department of Defense Civilian Employees on Responding to the Office of Personnel Management's \"What You Did Last Week\" Email \nJan. 29, 2025\n Restoring America's Fighting Force \nJan. 17, 2025\n FY2024 Annual Performance Report for the DOD Strategic Management Plan for FYs 2022 – 2026 \nJan. 17, 2025\n DoD PPBE Reform Implementation Plan \nJan. 10, 2025\n The United States of America-Republic of Korea Nuclear Consultative Group (NCG) Fact Sheet \nJan. 9, 2025\n Ukraine Fact Sheet – Jan. 9, 2025 \nJan. 9, 2025\n Key Achievements and Facts: U.S. Security Assistance to Ukraine \nJan. 7, 2025\n Entities Identified as Chinese Military Companies Operating in the United States \nJan. 2, 2025\n FY25 Investmen", "date": "2025-03-21T04:05:13+08:00"}, {"id": "sr_e958a9", "title": "Photos", "source": "www.defense.gov", "url": "https://www.defense.gov/Photos/Photo-Gallery/igphoto/2001520024/", "snippet": "Strategic Management Plan Navy Petty Officer 3rd Class Keyon Griffin salutes an EA-18G Growler aircraft as it taxis out to support Exercise Red Flag-Nellis 25-1 at Nellis Air Force Base, Nev., Feb. 5, 2025. The exercise provides realistic air combat experience in a controlled environment. Paratroopers assigned to 1st Squadron, 91st Cavalry Regiment, 173rd Airborne Brigade, fire a 120mm mortar during a live-fire exercise at the 7th Army Training Command's Grafenwoehr Training Area, Germany, Jan. 22, 2025. Air Force Airman 1st Class Brian Aipoalani snips a fuse wire on an inert guided bomb unit during a load crew competition at Creech Air Force Base, Nev., Jan. 24, 2025. The competition evaluated Tiger and Reaper Aircraft Maintenance Units on their ability to perform well under stress and qu", "date": "2025-02-10T15:38:19+08:00"}], "isIncremental": true, "searchType": "线索追踪", "depth": 2}}

